#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Admin > Settings, redesigned (the same settings, texts and save buttons as before).
 *  - The 15 sections in a menu on the left, in 4 groups (People & safety, Money rules, Website & app content, Documents & checks),
 *    with a "Find a setting" search; the chosen section opens on the right under a navy title card (group, name, one line on what it is).
 *    No more "More" menu: every section is one click away.
 *  - Team: each admin as a card (initials, name, "N of 22 pages"), the pages as pill switches, "Not saved yet" until saved; Add admin as a gold card.
 *  - Commission: totals on top (categories, average, lowest, highest), one tile per category with a big number and a bar; click to change.
 *  - Return window: 3 to 7 days as chips, and a line: Day 0 delivered -> Day N window closes (payout).
 *  - Receipt footer: English and Arabic side by side with a characters-left bar, and a small English and Arabic receipt showing the note.
 *  - Audit log: a filter bar with the count, actions grouped by day, coloured by kind (red removed, gold money), details as small tags.
 *  - Email test: one clear card, the answer in a green or red box.
 *  - EmailTestFlow.test.jsx: opens the "Email test" tab directly (there is no More menu now).
 * Admin only: no API change, no migration. Run from the project root: node scripts/patch-settings-redesign.js [--write]
 */
